      "entryId": "2pe-2-6",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The overthrow is an ensample for the ungodly-to-come. First principle: Sodom is exhibit A of coming judgment — ash-cities preach to later generations that the Lord knows how to rescue and to reserve.",
      "density": 2.2536,
