    },
    {
      "entryId": "2pe-3-13",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The promise-anchored expectation. First principle: looking is the discipline — Isaiah 65's creation promise is the horizon; righteousness is the resident of the new world.",
